-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 21.2.2008 (הסתדרות המורים) — תשלום בגין שחיקת שכר עובדי
-- הוראה מול שכר המהנדסים לשנים 2002–2007: the agreement between the
-- employers (the State, the Centre of Local Government and the three large
-- cities) and הסתדרות המורים that settles, for the union's teachers, the
-- second period of the erosion arbitration and the year 2007 together.
-- Whom it covers (§2); the 4% rise of the combined salary table and of the
-- 1987 and 1994 supplements from the salary of January 2008, on December
-- 2007's values, and the compensation of teachers who left, left to the
-- arbitrators (§3); the arbitration stopped save that question (§4);
-- exhaustion of the claims for 2002–2007 (§5); and when it is paid (§6).
--
-- ITS TWIN is ארגון המורים's agreement of 24.1.2008
-- (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/2008-01-24_oz-latmura_erosion-arbitration-award.l4,
-- imported), signed four weeks earlier, whose §3 this one prints save two
-- places: (ג) says the teachers who left "retired on a pension" in
-- 2003–2007, where the twin says they "ended their work" (finding
-- F-erosion-4pct-a), and (ד) prints another last month for repaying.
-- Where the words are the same the rule is the twin's, imported; where
-- they differ it is defined here.
--
-- WHAT IT CARRIES OUT: the arbitration deed of 1.2.2007, which both
-- organisations signed (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2007-02-01_teachers_erosion-arbitration-deed.l4,
-- imported through the twin). Its §4 stopping the union's arbitration is
-- what leaves the twin's §4(ב) — the difference if the union's
-- arbitration gave more — with nothing to pay; that is asserted below.
--
-- NOT A CLAIM IN THE ROOT, for the twin's reason: no pay item stands for
-- the rise of December 2007's table, and the agreement is registered in no
-- root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `2008-01-24_oz-latmura_erosion-arbitration-award`

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the word the batch found is
-- "בעל-פה" (the parties plead before the arbitrators orally or in
-- writing); the agreement pays nothing by sex.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תשלום בגין שחיקת שכר עובדי הוראה מול שכר המהנדסים לשנים 2002–2007 (הסתדרות המורים, 21.2.2008)`

DECLARE `Histadrut erosion agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `plead before the erosion arbitrators on the union's former teachers`
    `send the erosion arbitrators the union's joint notice that the arbitration stops`
    `pay the Histadrut erosion rise from the salary of February 2008`
    `negotiate further on the union's erosion of 2002–2007`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A handwritten note, "4% erosion"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 A fax banner (21.2.2008, from הסתדרות המורים); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 A date stamp, its year and a handwritten word illegible; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The second party, הסתדרות המורים, and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the arbitration deed of 1.2.07, as in the twin (`the Oz erosion agreement's arbitration deed was signed on`).
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the award of 22.5.07 for 1.1.99–31.12.01, as in the twin (`the first erosion award was given on`).
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: the panel is hearing the second period, as in the twin (`the second period this agreement settles`).
-- akn:preamble/p17 A recital: the parties agreed the rate of erosion for the second period and 2007 together, and how it is paid; the rules follow.
-- akn:preamble/p18 A recital: they set the understandings down in a collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p19 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶5: the day of signing, written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p5
`the Histadrut erosion agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 21 2 2008

#ASSERT `the Histadrut erosion agreement was signed on` `is on or after` `the Oz erosion agreement was signed on`

§§ `1 מבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the Histadrut erosion agreement's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

-- §2: every employee in the teaching scale ("עובדי הוראה") — of the
-- employers that sign it, the State and the local authorities, whichever
-- union he belongs to; another owner's teacher is outside it (convention
-- instruments.agreement-scope).
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee of the Histadrut erosion agreement` c IF
    NOT `is an owning body` (c's `employer`)

§§ `3 תשלום בגין שחיקת שכר עובדי הוראה מול שכר המהנדסים לשנים 2002 - 2007`

-- (א)–(ב): the twin's words — on top of the award's supplement paid from
-- January 2007, the combined salary table, תוספת 87' and תוספת 94' rise
-- by 4% from the salary of January 2008 (`the 2008 erosion rise on`), on
-- each one's December 2007 value (`the 2008 erosion rise added to a
-- component`), both imported. For the teacher of a case, on the case's
-- December 2007 combined salary:
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Histadrut erosion rise of the combined salary` c IS
    IF `a teaching employee of the Histadrut erosion agreement` c
    THEN `the 2008 erosion rise added to a component` (c's `the salary month`) (c's `combined salary in December 2007`)
    ELSE 0

-- (ג), as printed: one who gets a pension from an accumulating fund, or who
-- ended work not by retiring on a pension; who was an active teacher in
-- 2002–2007 or part of it; "ואשר פרשו לפנסיה בשנים 2003 – 2007" — and who
-- retired on a pension in 2003–2007. Read word for word, the last condition
-- shuts out the second kind it has just named: one who ended work not by
-- retiring never retired on a pension (finding F-erosion-4pct-a).
@ref akn:art_3__para_c
GIVEN t IS A `teacher who left, for the erosion compensation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the Histadrut erosion compensation group as printed` t IF
        (t's `gets a pension from an accumulating fund` OR t's `ended work not by retiring on a pension`)
    AND t's `was an active teacher in some of 2002–2007`
    AND NOT t's `ended work not by retiring on a pension`
    AND t's `the year work ended` AT LEAST 2003
    AND t's `the year work ended` AT MOST 2007

-- (ג), as read: "פרשו" is read as the end of work in 2003–2007, of either
-- kind, the reading that keeps the sentence's two kinds both in it
-- (convention reading.consistent) — the twin's own words, "סיימו
-- עבודתם". (ד) then leaves out the same two as the twin's (ד).
@ref akn:art_3__para_c akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN t IS A `teacher who left, for the erosion compensation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the Histadrut erosion compensation group` t IF
        `in the erosion compensation group as (ג) describes it` t
    AND NOT t's `was inactive in 2003–2007 for unpaid leave or a sabbatical`
    AND NOT t's `moved to another of the employers and is employed by one in 2008`

-- F-erosion-4pct-a's evidence: as printed, a teacher who resigned in 2005
-- after active years is outside the group the sentence names him in.
`§3(ג) of 21.2.2008 shuts out the teachers who ended work not by retiring` MEANS
        NOT `in the Histadrut erosion compensation group as printed` `a teacher who resigned in 2005`
    AND `in the Histadrut erosion compensation group` `a teacher who resigned in 2005`
#ASSERT `§3(ג) of 21.2.2008 shuts out the teachers who ended work not by retiring`

#ASSERT `in the Histadrut erosion compensation group as printed` `a retiree of 2005 on an accumulating fund`

-- (ג), the rest, as in the twin: the compensation is the arbitrators'
-- (`the former teachers' erosion compensation`, imported); the parties may
-- plead before them.
@ref akn:art_3__para_c
`pleading on the union's former teachers` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MAY   `plead before the erosion arbitrators on the union's former teachers`

-- (ד), last sentence: a teacher awarded compensation under (ג) who comes
-- back as a teacher to one of the employers by September 2009, that month
-- included, repays it; the duty is the twin's action, on the twin's month.
@ref akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN `the month he came back` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `he came back by the Histadrut agreement's last month for repaying` `the month he came back` IF
    `the month he came back` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2009)

GIVEN `the month he came back` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2008 erosion agreement action`
DECIDE `repaying the Histadrut erosion compensation` `the month he came back` IS
    IF `he came back by the Histadrut agreement's last month for repaying` `the month he came back`
    THEN PARTY `the teaching employee`
         MUST  `repay the erosion compensation`
    ELSE FULFILLED

#ASSERT `he came back by the Histadrut agreement's last month for repaying` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2009)
#ASSERT NOT `he came back by the Histadrut agreement's last month for repaying` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2009)

-- akn:art_3__para_e The twin's §3(ה), word for word: the decision within 30 days of the joint notice, 60 more as needed (`the decision on the former teachers' compensation`, imported).

§§ `4 הליך הבוררות`

-- §4: the arbitration under the deed for 1.1.02–31.12.06 stops when this
-- agreement is signed, save on §3(ג); the joint notice goes to the panel
-- right after.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
`the Histadrut arbitration went on beyond §3(ג), by this agreement` MEANS FALSE

`the union's joint notice to the erosion arbitrators` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MUST  `send the erosion arbitrators the union's joint notice that the arbitration stops`

-- Held to the twin: with the union's arbitration stopped at the same 4%,
-- the twin's §4(ב) owes ארגון המורים's teachers no difference.
#ASSERT `the difference owed the Oz teachers` `the Histadrut arbitration went on beyond §3(ג), by this agreement` `the 2008 erosion rise` EQUALS 0

§§ `5 מיצוי תביעות`

-- §5: full exhaustion of the claims on the erosion against the engineers
-- for 1.1.02–31.12.07, the 1993–1995 wage agreements' among them; no
-- further negotiation on it.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Histadrut erosion agreement exhausts the erosion claim for` y IF
    y AT LEAST 2002 AND y AT MOST 2007

`no further negotiation on the union's erosion of 2002–2007` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `negotiate further on the union's erosion of 2002–2007`

§§ `6 ביצוע ותשלומים`

-- §6: what the agreement pays is paid from the salary of February 2008;
-- the difference for January 2008 is paid with the salary of February 2008.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1
`the Histadrut erosion rise is first paid in the salary of` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2008

GIVEN `the salary month it is owed for` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the salary the Histadrut erosion rise is paid in` `the salary month it is owed for` IS
    IF `the salary month it is owed for` `is on or after` `the Histadrut erosion rise is first paid in the salary of`
    THEN `the salary month it is owed for`
    ELSE `the Histadrut erosion rise is first paid in the salary of`

#ASSERT `the salary the Histadrut erosion rise is paid in` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2008

`paying the Histadrut erosion rise` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `pay the Histadrut erosion rise from the salary of February 2008`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
